		{
			dependencies: ["7547756221DFC688"]
			description: ["The &6Thruster Works&r, &6Light Sail Fab&r and &6Cryogenic Plant&r make the motors and sails for the trip, with oganesson as the propellant. Oganesson from the cryogenic plant, and film from the aluminium line. The ICAN motor's pods and the sails. Pods and sails to ME; keep oganesson in its own tank."]
			icon: "gtceu:thruster_works"
			id: "166C0A74107A1EF3"
