		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7547756221DFC688"]
			description: ["The &6Large Chemical Reactor&r takes the era's new rows: solvents, propellant chemistry and the sulfide route. The raw materials from the Proxima liquors and the isotopes. Every liquor and solvent the machines above ask for. Pipe each product to its consumer; no tank should ever overflow."]
			icon: "gtceu:large_chemical_reactor"
